# Mercedes-Benz 230E (W124) four-door saloon, 1985-1995.
#
# The W124 "mid-size Benz": 4,740 mm long, 1,740 mm wide, 1,428 mm high,
# 2,800 mm wheelbase; 2.0-5.0 petrol and 2.5/3.0 diesel, the 230E the volume
# model in Britain. Facelift in 1989 and 1993.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_W124
#
# Colours: Black, Brilliant Silver, Nautical Blue and Smoke Silver are period
# Mercedes-Benz finishes.
#
# Weight: 140 in total (black 45, silver 40, blue 30, grey 25).
#
# Speed 220 km/h; comfort 115/350 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1985-1995 with a road tail to about 2007.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w124.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w124/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

